# This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites
# line endings on checkout. That is fine for our own sources, but not for
# redistributed third-party legal texts: those are canonical documents copied
# byte-for-byte from upstream metadata, and their bytes must survive a
# checkout unchanged or `tools/gen_third_party_notices.py --check` can never
# agree with what is committed.
third_party_licenses/** -text
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md -text
